#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:453
msgid "Choose where the PayPal buttons should appear on the cart page, either above or below the \"Proceed to Checkout\" button. This applies only to classic cart templates, not the new Cart Blocks layout."
